## Original Content
Au moins 47 personnes ont été tuées et 22 autres blessées lors d'une nouvelle attaque de gangs en #Haïti, selon un bilan provisoire de l’#ONU. La population dénonce le manque de protection face aux #violences répétées dans un pays en proie au chaos sécuritaire.

## Summary
At least 47 people were killed and 22 injured in a new gang attack in Haiti, as reported by the UN in a preliminary toll. The incident has sparked public outcry over inadequate protection from repeated violence in the country's ongoing security crisis.

## Key Points
- The gang attack in Haiti resulted in at least 47 deaths and 22 injuries.
- The violence is attributed to a coalition of gangs.
- The UN provided a preliminary report on the casualties.
- Haitian citizens denounce the lack of protection amid escalating security chaos.


